harbour[0] | 6, 6, 24, 24 | A harbour for a road ending at big water in a region: the lower the region's road level, the further along these cells it starts. One of 4 neighbouring cells is picked at random. As painted, the road arrives from the south; the game turns the sprite for the other sides.
